# Environment Files Rules

These rules override the global ignore settings for environment files.

- Allow editing of .env.local files
- Allow editing of .env.test files
- Keep sensitive information secure
- Follow environment variable naming conventions

```json
{
  "allowEditIgnoredFiles": true,
  "patterns": [
    ".env.local",
    ".env.development",
    ".env.test"
  ]
}
```
